---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
const updated = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-GB', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }).format(new Date());
---
<Base title="Privacy notice" description="How KES Crust Co. looks after the details you give us through the Crust Club and the enquiry form.">
  <section class="block block--cream page-head" aria-labelledby="pv-title">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="label" style="color:var(--burgundy)">The small print, in plain English</p>
      <h1 id="pv-title">Privacy notice</h1>
      <p class="lede">We're three friends who make pizza, not a data company. Here's exactly what we keep and why.</p>
      <p><small>Last updated {updated}</small></p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>{site.name} is responsible for the personal information collected on this website. Questions or requests: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>

      <h2>What we collect and why</h2>
      <h3>Crust Club</h3>
      <p>If you join, we keep your <strong>email address</strong> and the date you joined so we can tell you about new dates. We rely on your <strong>consent</strong>, and you can withdraw it any time by emailing us or using the unsubscribe link in any email we send.</p>
      <h3>Event enquiries</h3>
      <p>If you send an enquiry we keep what you type in the form: the occasion, date, rough guest numbers, location, any notes, your <strong>name, email</strong> and (if you give it) <strong>phone number</strong>. We use it only to reply and plan your event, because you asked us to (steps before a contract / legitimate interests).</p>

      <h2>Where it's kept and who sees it</h2>
      <p>Your details are stored with our database provider, Supabase, on servers in London (UK). Only the three of us can see them, using a PIN-protected crew area. We never sell or share your details for marketing.</p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Crust Club emails: until you unsubscribe.</li>
        <li>Enquiries: up to 12 months after your event (or after we last spoke), then deleted.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies and your device</h2>
      <p>This site doesn't use tracking cookies, so there's no cookie banner. Your favourite pizzas, your order list and your "pause animations" choice are saved only in your own browser and never sent to us.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete the information we hold about you, or object to how we use it. Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we'll sort it within a month. If you're not happy with how we've handled your data you can complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose { max-width: 720px; }
  .prose h1 { margin: 6px 0 14px; }
  .prose h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.2rem); margin: 36px 0 10px; }
  .prose h3 { color: var(--burgundy); margin: 18px 0 6px; }
  .prose p, .prose li { max-width: 62ch; }
  .prose p + p { margin-top: 10px; }
  .prose ul { padding-left: 1.2em; display: grid; gap: 4px; }
  .prose a { font-weight: 700; color: var(--burgundy); }
</style>
